      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with a cough driven by acid reflux at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more.",
