      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a cough driven by acid reflux, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a dry cough that won't go away for about a month, and no shortness of breath or night sweats.",
