      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd like to arrange breathing tests for chronic cough. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'll start you on pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast, for four weeks. That's for reflux. Don't eat for two or three hours before lying down, and raise the head of the bed a little. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference.",
